  "subject": "In a bridal-photo studio's second-floor set the groom looks at the bride instead of the lens in all forty shots; the photographer sighs, the make-up artist retouches again, and she decides to keep that look.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien fado, slow Lisbon tavern ballad. Portuguese guitarra playing bright ringing arpeggios and short answering phrases; classical guitar strumming a steady slow chord pulse; double bass holding long low notes; soft brushed snare barely marking the beat. Intimate small-room mix, natural reverb, plain close vocal. Female alto, dark warm chest voice with slow vibrato, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 72 BPM, D minor. Tender, wry, quietly adoring. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no drum machine, no synth pads, no EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n婚紗店二樓 白色布幕\n攝影師講 看遮 看遮\n你的目睭 閣走去佗位\n偏偏 攏看我這爿\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n四十張相矣 全部是按呢\n伊看的 毋是鏡頭\n\n[Chorus]\n毋看鏡頭 伊攏看我\n看甲攝影師 笑出聲\n這張相若洗出來\n逐家就知 伊的心\n\n[Verse]\n禮服較重 領結歪一爿\n伊的手心 全是汗\n我共手巾 遞過去\n伊閣看我 袂記得擦\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n化妝師補粉 補第三擺\n伊猶原 無看鏡頭\n\n[Chorus]\n毋看鏡頭 伊攏看我\n看甲化妝師 嘛笑矣\n這張相若洗出來\n逐家就知 伊的心\n\n[Verse]\n第三套衫 規晝矣\n便當食冷 無人想欲食\n攝影師共鏡頭 放落\n講 恁自然就好\n\n[Bridge]\n免閣喝矣 按呢就好\n愛看就看 我袂閃\n\n[Chorus]\n毋看鏡頭 伊攏看我\n看甲我嘛 面紅紅\n這張相若洗出來\n逐家就知 阮的心\n\n[Outro]\n毋看鏡頭 伊攏看我\n這世人的 第一張相",
